  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture Vegetable Market Garden (Self-help Grant).Beneficiaries: 3,240 of which 2,267 are women .This small grant vegetable market garden project will help small scale garden farmers to earn increased income. USADF funds will help 3,240 people to purchase equipment, machinery, training, workshops , travel, supplies and materials. .</narrative>
